        IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
        PROGRAM-ID. AUNCIENT-FPGA-BEYOND-620.
        ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
        DATA DIVISION.
        WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
        01  WS-FPGA-BEYOND-620-STATE.
            05  WS-TPA-BASE-ADDR            PIC 9(05) VALUE 00256.
            05  WS-TH621-ASSEMBLEIT-OK      PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-TH622-LIAISON-DAT-OK     PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-TH623-MATE-LAT-OK        PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-TH624-625M-SAAT-OK       PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
